privacy+='''<article class="wrap prose"><div class="notice"><strong>Preview notice — review before a business launch.</strong>This page describes the preview and summarises the practice’s published privacy information. The owner must approve a complete production notice covering the final platform and enquiry handling.</div><h2>Using this preview</h2><p>The enquiry form creates a draft in your browser. It does not send or store your message on this website. If you open the draft in your email app, that app handles the message; you choose whether to send it.</p><p>This preview sets no analytics or marketing cookies and uses no browser storage. GitHub Pages handles website hosting; its own processing applies. External audio and video players connect only when you choose to load them. Third-party providers may process information and use cookies. You can use the direct media links instead.</p><h2>Information held by the practice</h2><p>The existing notice describes collecting contact, identity and financial information for accountancy and related services, with disclosure for statutory obligations and retention according to service, legal and investigation requirements. It describes access, correction, erasure and objection rights.</p><p>For privacy enquiries, contact the office at <a href="mailto:info@frisbyassoc.ie">info@frisbyassoc.ie</a> or <a href="tel:+35316217050">+353 (0)1 621 7050</a>.</p><h2>Before sharing information</h2><p>Keep sensitive documents and identifiers out of a general enquiry. Ask the team how to provide them securely.</p></article>'''
